1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:06,313
TinyDB is a tiny, document oriented database optimized for your happiness.

2
00:00:06,313 --> 00:00:10,550
It has 14 classes in 7 modules, with 1557 lines of methods.

3
00:00:10,550 --> 00:00:13,924
The largest planet is Table, followed by Query.

4
00:00:13,924 --> 00:00:20,458
The 51 lines of light between planets are calls and references that cross class boundaries.

5
00:00:23,058 --> 00:00:25,881
TinyDB. The main class of TinyDB.

6
00:00:25,881 --> 00:00:29,217
172 lines, 12 gates, 12 of them public.

7
00:00:29,217 --> 00:00:32,981
For the type checker only, it extends Table.

8
00:00:32,981 --> 00:00:36,317
It uses Table, Storage and JSONStorage.

9
00:00:38,917 --> 00:00:42,395
Table. Represents a single TinyDB table.

10
00:00:42,395 --> 00:00:45,787
700 lines, 20 gates, 17 of them public.

11
00:00:45,787 --> 00:00:50,048
It uses LRUCache, Document, QueryLike and 1 more.

12
00:00:50,048 --> 00:00:51,874
It is used by TinyDB.

13
00:00:54,474 --> 00:00:57,549
Document. A document stored in the database.

14
00:00:57,549 --> 00:00:59,926
3 lines, 1 gate, 1 of them public.

15
00:00:59,926 --> 00:01:01,324
It is used by Table.

16
00:01:04,974 --> 00:01:05,696
LRUCache.

17
00:01:05,696 --> 00:01:10,350
A least-recently used (LRU) cache with a fixed cache size.

18
00:01:10,350 --> 00:01:13,400
48 lines, 10 gates, 10 of them public.

19
00:01:13,400 --> 00:01:15,005
It is used by Table.

20
00:01:17,605 --> 00:01:19,592
Query. TinyDB Queries.

21
00:01:19,592 --> 00:01:23,115
335 lines, 22 gates, 21 of them public.

22
00:01:23,115 --> 00:01:27,450
It extends QueryInstance. It uses QueryInstance.

23
00:01:30,050 --> 00:01:32,566
QueryInstance. A query instance.

24
00:01:32,566 --> 00:01:35,397
53 lines, 9 gates, 7 of them public.

25
00:01:35,397 --> 00:01:36,970
It is used by Query.

26
00:01:40,550 --> 00:01:41,282
QueryLike.

27
00:01:41,282 --> 00:01:44,282
A typing protocol that acts like a query.

28
00:01:44,282 --> 00:01:46,842
2 lines, 2 gates, 0 of them public.

29
00:01:46,842 --> 00:01:48,306
It is used by Table.

30
00:01:51,050 --> 00:01:54,872
Storage. The abstract base class for all Storages.

31
00:01:54,872 --> 00:01:57,623
26 lines, 3 gates, 3 of them public.

32
00:01:57,623 --> 00:02:02,056
It is used by TinyDB, CachingMiddleware, Table and 1 more.

33
00:02:04,656 --> 00:02:08,334
JSONStorage. Store the data in a JSON file.

34
00:02:08,334 --> 00:02:11,413
75 lines, 4 gates, 4 of them public.

35
00:02:11,413 --> 00:02:14,920
It extends Storage. It is used by TinyDB.

36
00:02:17,520 --> 00:02:20,951
MemoryStorage. Store the data as JSON in memory.

37
00:02:20,951 --> 00:02:23,524
11 lines, 3 gates, 3 of them public.

38
00:02:23,524 --> 00:02:24,883
It extends Storage.

39
00:02:24,883 --> 00:02:27,528
No lines connect it to other classes.

40
00:02:30,128 --> 00:02:33,567
Middleware. The base class for all Middlewares.

41
00:02:33,567 --> 00:02:36,201
51 lines, 3 gates, 2 of them public.

42
00:02:36,201 --> 00:02:37,372
It uses Storage.

43
00:02:40,628 --> 00:02:44,141
CachingMiddleware. Add some caching to TinyDB.

44
00:02:44,141 --> 00:02:46,890
51 lines, 5 gates, 3 of them public.

45
00:02:46,890 --> 00:02:49,869
It extends Middleware. It uses Storage.

46
00:02:52,469 --> 00:02:55,101
FrozenDict. An immutable dictionary.

47
00:02:55,101 --> 00:02:57,659
9 lines, 4 gates, 0 of them public.

48
00:02:57,659 --> 00:03:00,364
No lines connect it to other classes.

49
00:03:02,969 --> 00:03:06,549
TinyDBPlugin. A plugin for the mypy type checker.

50
00:03:06,549 --> 00:03:08,595
This class has no docstring.

51
00:03:08,595 --> 00:03:11,226
21 lines, 2 gates, 0 of them public.

52
00:03:11,226 --> 00:03:13,929
No lines connect it to other classes.

53
00:03:16,529 --> 00:03:21,080
That is the whole of tinydb: fourteen classes, held together by lines of light.
